  "result": "Both per-workspace override problems are fixed in the code; I haven't run the test suite.\n\n- **Switching an override off now sticks.** The repository's `updateOrg` was merging the stored override list with the patch, so removed flags came back. A supplied `enabledFlagOverrides` list now replaces the stored one, and an omitted one keeps it (`src/server/repositories/organization-repository.ts`).\n- **Non-overridable features are rejected and ignored.** `toggleFlag` used to let plan-gated, non-overridable flags through. The new `assertOverridable` in `src/server/services/feature-flag-service.ts` rejects any non-overridable flag. The toggle action calls it before its no-op early return, so a request like enabling webhooks on Free now errors instead of silently succeeding. `isEnabled` in `src/lib/feature-flags.ts` only honours a stored override when the flag is overridable.",
